      "entryId": "soushenji-11-04",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "楚干将莫邪为楚王作剑，三年乃成，王怒"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "chuci",
      "chapterIndex": 12,
      "entryId": "chuci-12-02",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "。\n\n舒佩兮綝纚,\n\n竦余剑兮干将。\n\n腾蛇兮后从,\n\n飞駏兮步"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "chuci",
      "chapterIndex": 13,
      "entryId": "chuci-13-03",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "簏。\n\n执棠谿以剩蓬兮,\n\n秉干将以割肉。\n\n筐泽泻以豹鞟兮,\n"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 22,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-22-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "，攘倦一捣，则折胁伤干，为此弃干将、莫邪而以手战，则悖矣。所谓言"
    }
  ],
